cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Qaiji-IR (开济IR): A Cross-Layer Quantum-Classical Digital-Twin Intermediate Representation"
message: >-
  If you use Qaiji-IR, cite the software metadata in this file and use a
  version-specific DOI for the exact code. For the IR architecture, also
  cite the arXiv preprint listed in references.
type: software
authors:
